      "format": "plain",
      "value": "I am an artist and small business owner who likes to spend a lot of time in nature, observing birds and wildlife. My designs are an appreciation of nature and are one-of-a-kind designs that are expressive for those who like pieces that are elegant, cute, and unique (an intersection that is difficult to achieve).",
