    {
      "id": "cmpn043xt002iibnzz4wa3dq0",
      "key": "legal.policies_mdx",
      "label": "Store policies (MDX)",
      "format": "mdx",
      "value": "# Store policies\n\nStarter text for a small shop. **Have a lawyer review** before you rely on it in production — this file lives at `content/policies.mdx` so you can edit copy without touching React.\n\n## Terms of service\n\nBy placing an order, you agree to pay the listed price plus applicable taxes and shipping. Product colours may vary slightly by screen and print batch.\n\nWe reserve the right to cancel orders that look fraudulent or where inventory cannot be fulfilled — you will be refunded in full through your payment provider (Stripe).\n\n## Privacy\n\nCheckout is processed by **Stripe**. We receive the information needed to fulfill your order (name, shipping address, email). We do not store full card numbers on our servers.\n\n## Cookies\n\nThis storefront may set essential cookies for checkout flows and admin sessions. Add analytics or marketing cookie language if you enable those tools.\n\n## Contact\n\nQuestions about these policies? Use the [contact form](/contact) or the email shown on that page.\n",
      "updatedAt": "2026-05-28T00:25:08.504Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "cmpn043z3002jibnzmlmbr2fb",
      "key": "legal.shipping_mdx",
      "label": "Shipping & returns (MDX)",
      "format": "mdx",
      "value": "# Shipping & returns\n\n## Shipping\n\n- Orders typically ship within **2–5 business days** unless stated otherwise on the product page.\n- Tracking is sent by email when your package leaves our studio or fulfillment partner.\n- **International orders** — add duties, taxes, and carrier notes here.\n\n## Returns & exchanges\n\n- We accept returns of unworn items within **14 days of delivery** (customize your window).\n- Initiate a return by emailing support with your order number — wire your helpdesk when ready.\n- **Final sale** items — list categories here if applicable.\n\n## Need help?\n\nSee [store policies](/policies) or [contact us](/contact).\n",
      "updatedAt": "2026-05-28T00:25:08.549Z"
    },
